    <span><span class="swatch" style="background:#1f4a8c"></span>full data path</span>
    <span><span class="swatch" style="background:#b8412a"></span>via $T$ path</span>
    <span><span class="swatch" style="background:#94a3b8"></span>$\theta$-free residual</span>
    <span><span class="swatch" style="background:#2d7a3e"></span>edge content (sparkline)</span>
